      "message": "https://yarchive.net/comp/linux/64bit_divide.html\n(see last comment)\n\nit\u0027s probably safe here since\nthe 64 bit counter won\u0027t wrap around in our lifetime,\nso we won\u0027t hit the case where the 32 bit quotient\njumps back to 0 without wrapping around.\nthe comparator is set to CLOCK_FACTOR * 2^32, so\nthis effectively emulates 32-bit wrap-around.",
